{"name":"Fuzzy Navel","hex":"#ffd69f","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"fuzzy navel","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A cocktail, usually made with peach schnapps and orange juice.","A drink or food (of a specified type) which imitates this cocktail by featuring peach and orange as central flavours (with or without alcohol)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/fuzzy_navel"}],"entries":[{"title":"Fuzzy navel","blocks":[{"text":"A fuzzy navel is a mixed drink made from peach schnapps and orange juice. Generally an equal amount of each component is used to concoct it, although quantities may vary. It can also be made with lemonade or a splash of vodka depending on the drinker's taste. The addition of another 1 or 1+1⁄2 oz of vodka to the fuzzy navel creates a \"hairy navel\", the more \"hair\" referring to the increased strength of alcohol in the drink. A \"Hairy Navel\" or \"Fuzzy Russian\" recipe may include 1 part vodka, 1 part peach schnapps, and 4 parts orange juice."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f6/Fuzzy_navel_01.jpg/330px-Fuzzy_navel_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fuzzy_navel","wikidata":"Q5511137"},{"title":"Navel","blocks":[{"text":"The navel is a protruding, flat, or hollowed area on the abdomen at the attachment site of the umbilical cord."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Human_navel%2C_female.jpg/330px-Human_navel%2C_female.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Navel","wikidata":"Q43801"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Da_Vinci_Vitruve_Luc_Viatour.jpg/500px-Da_Vinci_Vitruve_Luc_Viatour.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Da_Vinci_Vitruve_Luc_